[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303549593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110586#issuecomment-3303549593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110586","id":3303549593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E6CqZ","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T15:31:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T15:31:20Z","body":"Cannot replicate it under Arch Linux. Color picker opens as expected:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ebd1d9d-0a0d-4d2a-ae1c-92d75fe4fbbf\n\nCan you try if the single window mode fixes this (**Editor Settings** > **Interface** > **Editor** > **Single Window Mode**)? Could you also try it on the previous stable version `v4.4.1`?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303549593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303913831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110586#issuecomment-3303913831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110586","id":3303913831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E7bln","user":{"login":"AlexandraMercier","id":9421924,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MjE5MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9421924?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexandraMercier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T17:20:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T17:20:17Z","body":"From the error message, it seems to be an issue with MacOS's screen capture permission.\n```\nDyld Error Message:\nSymbol not found: _CGPreflightScreenCaptureAccess\nReferenced from: /Applications/Godot 4/Godot 4.5.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot\nExpected in: /System/Library/Frameworks/CoreGraphics.framework/Versions/A/CoreGraphics\n```\nFrom [this stack overflow](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/73583024/how-can-i-find-out-which-symbol-is-causing-dyld-missing-symbol-called), `Dyld symbol not found` is called when the method called is declared but not defined. \nIn this case, the undefined method is `CGPreflightScreenCaptureAccess`, which handles screen capture permissions.\n\nLooking around, I found [this github thread](https://github.com/nashaofu/xcap/issues/160) which mentions `CGPreflightScreenCaptureAccess` will be migrated into [ScreenCaptureKit](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ScreenCaptureKit) and thus cause some issues. However, I can't seem to find the text cited in the thread and the migration concerns macos sequoia, while the issue is in macosx (catalina).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303913831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303963165","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110586#issuecomment-3303963165","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110586","id":3303963165,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E7nod","user":{"login":"AlexandraMercier","id":9421924,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MjE5MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9421924?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexandraMercier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T17:36:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T17:56:54Z","body":"[Edit for better phrasing]\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8b4b93a82e13cb1b7ea5fa28b39163a6311a0bb3/scene/gui/color_picker.cpp#L2391-L2396\n\nIt looks like the color picker needs screen record permissions on macos. \n\nUpdate: I found the PR that added the permissions. #105507 It was to be able to colorpick from opened windows, as in 4.4, the color picker only considered the computer's wallpaper when color picking outside the godot app on mac os (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105491) ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303963165/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304025097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110586#issuecomment-3304025097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110586","id":3304025097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E72wJ","user":{"login":"AlexandraMercier","id":9421924,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MjE5MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9421924?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexandraMercier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/orgs","repos_url":"ht